{"version":1,"content":"<p>塞爾達傳説40周年版Nintendo Switch 2目前已在任天堂數字商店售罄。商品頁面曾短暫提示「更多庫存將於2027年1月到貨」，但任天堂隨後刪除了具體月份，因此這一補貨時間尚未得到最終確認。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1587394.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T10:23:53.184451+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T10:13:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T10:17:13.840354+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T10:17:13.840354+00:00","content_hash":"018ece9164a03ec8cc3e8f66547ab6015d56902499e535bfcef97f08d29b6a2a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}